# Frontend (FE/)

## Stack

- Svelte 5 with runes enabled (`$state`, `$effect`, `$props`, `$derived`)
- SvelteKit static adapter → `FE/build/`
- Tailwind CSS 4 via `@tailwindcss/vite`
- Leaflet + MapLibre GL for map preview

## Aliases

- `@lib` → `FE/src/lib`
- `@shared` → `shared/` (map styles, layer defaults)

## Patterns

- API calls in `FE/src/lib/api/` — use relative `/api/*` paths (Vite proxies to `:8787`)
- Components in `FE/src/lib/components/`; map helpers in `FE/src/lib/map/`
- Use `createDefaultMapLayers()` from `@shared/map-style` for layer state
- Debounce expensive API calls (see `scheduleEstimate` in `+page.svelte`)
- Use sequence counters to ignore stale async responses

## UI style

- Tailwind utility classes; amber/stone palette
- Rounded cards: `rounded-2xl bg-white shadow-sm ring-1 ring-stone-200`
- No component library — keep markup simple and consistent with existing pages

## Checks

```bash
npm run check --prefix FE   # svelte-check
npm run build --prefix FE   # before deploy
```
